## October 3, 2026

**Human Director:** Shawn Vibert

## Current Signal
**The Hub has crossed from concept toward product.**

The visual identity, information architecture, room model, design language, and governance laws are now substantially coherent. The remaining challenge is making the existing vision real without degrading it.

